================================================================================

6.1 Components
--------------

The project should be split into these components:

A. Data acquisition
B. Data preprocessing
C. Asset serialization/cache
D. Route generation/definition
E. Rendering engine
F. Simulation engine
G. UI/input/FPS overlay
H. Configuration and logging

