Future 8: Production renderer

- Consider C++/Rust + Vulkan/Metal/OpenGL.
- Consider bgfx/wgpu.
- Consider MapLibre Native-style architecture.

Future 9: OSM vector tile pipeline

- Convert OSM data into vector tiles.
- Render based on tile pyramid and styles.

Future 10: Navigation/route import

- Import route from OSRM/Valhalla/GraphHopper.
- Simulate turn-by-turn navigation.

