================================================================================
20. RECOMMENDED FIRST IMPLEMENTATION ORDER
================================================================================

The fastest path to visible success is:

1. Make a ModernGL window and render a cube.
2. Use fake/simple geometry first: a few roads, a few boxes, a fake route.
3. Implement RoutePlayer and moving marker on fake route.
4. Then add OSMnx download.
5. Then add projection.
6. Then add real roads.
7. Then add real route.
8. Then add buildings.
9. Then improve visual quality and controls.

Reason:

If rendering, camera, and animation are proven first, OSM preprocessing bugs are easier to isolate. If the project starts with full OSM geometry and no renderer yet, debugging becomes slower and more confusing.

